  "prefLabel": "Hum 320.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Hum 320.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to provide uniform procedures for the conduct of public comment hearings held pursuant to RSA 541-A:11.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Hum 300) #8815-A, eff 2-3-07",
